## Group Explorer entity behaviour into one section
================================================================================

Context: Clicking an entity in Graph Explorer showed separate Actions and
Inference rules blocks (and a What-if block on the details pane). Operators
asked to regroup those runtime triggers the way Ontology Studio groups them
under Behaviour.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js
   Merge functions, jobs, and SWRL rules into one Behaviour section and
   context-menu group.
2. src/front/static/query/js/query-entity-details.js
   Same grouping, including Simulate from here.
3. tests/units/front/test_entity_panel_tabs.py
   Contract the single Behaviour heading.

